#ASSERT `s 486.7(2) the application may be made to the judge or justice` `s 486(1.1) before the proceedings begin` `s 486(1.1) any judge or justice having jurisdiction in the judicial district where the proceedings will take place` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING   -- the judge who will preside has been determined: the grant is limited to that judge
